      "statusChangeID": "5f0bc1cf2a84fa77c6b16b8e",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Updated the documentation on [Additive](https://docs.vrchat.com/v2020.2.3-av3/docs/avatars-30#additive) and [Gesture](https://docs.vrchat.com/v2020.2.3-av3/docs/avatars-30#gesture) to clarify some things. \nAdditive should only be used in cases where the bones you're \"adding on to\" are animated in Base-- by default, only your Mechanim humanoid bones. Since your tail/wings are not animated in Base, you're adding on to nothing, which will result in strange behavior.\nShort answer: This isn't a bug! This is us not providing proper documentation. Use Gesture instead for non-humanoid bone \"idle\" animations.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
