      "mergedPostDetails": "I'm currently experimenting with the additive animations through the radial menu. I have created a mask so it only animates specific and unique bones that are connected to the armature. When the animation is played, the bones are animating correctly but they're all offset whether its humanoid or generic. \nEverything works fine inside of Unity but in VRChat, everything is offset.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[FEEDBACK] [BUG] Additive animations do not work correctly",
